Hi Geliang,

On 16/01/2025 08:26, Geliang Tang wrote:
> From: Geliang Tang <tanggeliang@kylinos.cn>
> 
> v4:
>  - add a new patch, "add a build check for userspace_pm_dump_addr" as
>    Matt suggested.
